# Skyward Spider: an Aura counts as a modification only if its controller also controls the enchanted creature (CR 700.9). Bot2
# casts Holy Strength on Bot1's Spider on turn 2 (the ward {2} is paid with its other two Moxen): the Spider is enchanted but not
# modified, so it has no flying, and when it attacks on turn 5 Bot2's Runeclaw Bear may block it. After combat Bot1 casts its own
# Holy Strength on it, and it has flying (the Auras on it are Bot1's and Bot2's).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Skyward Spider
Holy Strength
Plains x2
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Holy Strength
Runeclaw Bear
Island x4
Island x10

