Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Holy Strength.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Skyward Spider)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skyward Spider.Keywords = Flying

